    "sub_name": "專業實習(二)",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNSHIP (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為下學期遴選研究所學生提供至產業進行實務接軌的機會。旨在加強理論與實務的整合，以強化學生專業技能，提升未來就業競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides an opportunity to select graduate students in the next semester to integrate practically into the industry. In addition, it aims to strengthen the integration of theory and practice to strengthen students' professional skills and enhance their future employment competitiveness.",
